>> title: Sugar Cookies
>> category: Cookies
>> tags: sugar, butter, rolled, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: cut-out cookies, cutout cookies, rolled sugar cookies
>> servings: 48
>> time: 2 hours

Heat the #oven{} to 375°F (190°C) and line two #baking sheets{} with parchment.

Cream @unsalted butter{1%cup}(226 g; softened) with @granulated sugar{1%cup}(200 g).

>> step: beat in
Beat @egg{1%large}(50 g), @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL), and @almond extract{1/2%tsp}(2.5 mL) into @&(~1)creamed butter{}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{2 1/2%cup}(315 g), @baking powder{1%tsp}(4.8 g), and @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g).

Stir @&(~1)dry ingredients{} into @&(~2)batter{}.

Wrap @&(~1)dough{} and chill for ~{1%hour}.

>> step: roll 1/4 in thick, cut out, bake 375°F (190°C) 8 min
Roll @&(~1)dough{} 1/4 in thick, cut out shapes, and bake at 375°F for ~{8%min}.
